text: >-
  The fact that Robinson is "still" OK and is stuck in Orem "a little while
  longer yet" only makes

  sense if Twiggs already has some awareness of the situation. Moreover, the
  fact that he tells his

  roommate that it shouldn't be long before he comes "home" implies that Lance
  is already waiting

  for him, and is not completely in the dark. From this we see how uneasily the
  later keyboard

  tory sits with what was the initial fabrication. Equally damning is the fact
  that Lance has to ask

  yler whether he committed the crime despite being told that in the note that
  he had just read

  (compare: "What?????????????? You're joking, right????" and "you weren't the
  one who did it

  right????").
